      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=80>Simple Destruction</size>\nThis is not exactly a tool but rather
    just a showcase \nof how easy it is to add this sort of logic to your game\nAdding
    <color=#00ff00>Destruction</color> can make your game feel much more satisfying\nThe
    trick is slicing your object into multiple pieces, spawning that prefab and applying\nan
    explosion force.\nWatch the <color=#00ff00>Tutorial Video</color> to learn more."
